  "body": "Here’s your opportunity to secure a beautifully maintained home in a secure, peaceful and private setting, just an easy stroll from everything that makes Orewa such a wonderful place to live.\r\n\r\nLovingly cared for, this immaculate standalone three bedroom brick and tile home sits proudly on a sunny, low maintenance freehold site, with a lovely outlook across Victor Eaves Park.\r\n\r\nStep inside and you’ll immediately appreciate the light filled feel of this home. The well designed layout features a spacious open plan kitchen and dining area, capturing the morning sun and flowing effortlessly through to the comfortable living room. With its sunny aspect, peaceful outlook and excellent sense of privacy, this is a home that feels both welcoming and wonderfully easy to live in.\r\n\r\nThree good sized bedrooms are complemented by a semi ensuite family bathroom, separate second toilet and internal access garage, providing all the practicality you need.\r\n\r\nOutside, the manageable garden is just the right size for pottering, entertaining or simply enjoying the sunshine without spending your weekends maintaining it.\r\n\r\nPositioned well off the road and secured by two gates, you’ll enjoy an added sense of peace and privacy. Best of all, the location makes everyday living incredibly convenient, with the beach, cafés, shops, parks and local amenities all within easy level walking distance.\r\n\r\nSunny, private, beautifully presented and perfectly positioned, this is coastal living made easy.\r\n\r\nIf you’ve been looking for a home that offers comfort, convenience and a relaxed Orewa lifestyle, this one deserves to be on your viewing list.\r\n\r\nCall us today or come along to our next open home.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
